{"id":"gegensatz","lemma":"Gegensatz","pos":"noun","rank":3005,"glosses":["opposition, antagonism","opposite","conflict, contradiction"],"ipa":"/ˈɡeːɡn̩zats/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/De-Gegensatz.ogg/De-Gegensatz.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Gegensatzes","plural":"Gegensätze"},"examples":[{"text":"Gegensätze ziehen sich an.","en":"Opposites attract.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392073","words":[null,{"g":"to pull"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"„Liebe“ und „Hass“ sind Gegensätze.","en":"“Love” and “hate” are opposites.","words":[{"g":"lovable","l":"lieb"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"hatred, hate"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Im Gegensatz zu gestern ist es heute überhaupt nicht heiß.","en":"It isn't anywhere near as hot today as it was yesterday.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"today"},null,null,{"g":"hot"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"not at all"]]},{"text":"Ich hoffe auf Regen, im Gegensatz zu Tom.","en":"I'm hoping it'll rain. Tom is hoping it won't.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hope","l":"hoffen"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"rain"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Im Gegensatz zu ihrem Bruder, ist Sienna sehr introvertiert.","en":"Unlike her brother, Sienna is very introverted.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"very"},null]}]}